Mlmmj 1.2.18.1 has just been released. It simply fixes three bugs, one
of which caused mail to be lost, so everybody currently running 1.2.18.0
is encouraged to upgrade.

Downloads page: http://mlmmj.org/downloads
ChangeLog: http://mlmmj.org/hg/mlmmj/file/RELEASE_1_2_18_1/ChangeLog

